OL,3,GNEWSAWhy face coverings could be banned
OL,4,Ain Redditch
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor is calling for a ban on
OL,7,Fface coverings, saying people are being
OL,8,F"intimidated" by youths wearing
OL,9,Fbalaclavas.
OL,11,FCouncillor Nic Pioli, who leads the
OL,12,FReform group on Redditch Borough
OL,13,FCouncil, wants the town to follow areas
OL,14,Flike Nottingham and Wolverhampton in
OL,15,Fcracking down on their use, with the
OL,16,Fauthority set to have talks with West
OL,17,FMercia Police over the issue.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
